  "prefLabel": "Agr 4005.04 Failure to Comply",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 4005.04 Failure to Comply. If the grantee is found out of compliance with the provisions of the contract, the grantee shall repay to the state general fund the principal amount of the grant plus interest calculated at the rate of interest on state of New Hampshire general obligation bonds issued most closely to the date of authorization of the grant.\n\nSource. #13816, eff 12-1-23\n\nAPPENDIX A",
